    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "57b7b6b5_294e84b3",
        "filename": "common/nvmem_vars.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 340,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000187
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-12-20T21:21:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Seems like we could keep the local copy around as a cache, so we don\u0027t waste time re-reading it on the next load.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 340,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 340,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "f1f71ecf540e9489e4bbee9474aa1b0614960b4e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "57b7b6b5_64810399",
        "filename": "common/nvmem_vars.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 340,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000058
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-12-20T22:00:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No..., the idea is that you do all your getvar()/setvar() first, then finally call writevars() when you\u0027re done. We\u0027d like to allocate the RAM only when needed and return it afterwards. We\u0027d only need to allocate it for setenv(), except for those systems that don\u0027t have memory-mapped flash.",
      "parentUuid": "57b7b6b5_294e84b3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 340,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 340,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "f1f71ecf540e9489e4bbee9474aa1b0614960b4e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "57b7b6b5_e4d65354",
        "filename": "common/nvmem_vars.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 340,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000187
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-12-20T22:25:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, until we implement per-variable per-boot locking.  Then we\u0027ll need to keep the variables around, so that we know whether they\u0027ve been locked this boot or not.",
      "parentUuid": "57b7b6b5_64810399",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 340,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 340,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "f1f71ecf540e9489e4bbee9474aa1b0614960b4e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
